.SH NAME
repeat \- repeat a command
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B repeat
\fIcount command\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
The specified 
.I command
is subject to the same restrictions as the
.I command
in the one line
statement above and is executed
.I count
times.
I/O redirections occurs exactly once, even if
.I count
is 0.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fIThe C Shell\fR in the ZEUS Utilities Manual
